VUURWERK UV-K6 APRS / Dustpan95 UVK5 — modified complete firmware fork

This project retains the complete VUURWERK source package and base history.
Original copyright/license notices remain in their source files. New changes
are marked in modified inherited files and described in docs/INTEGRATION.md.

Original projects and contributions:

James Honiball (KC3TFZ), Tokeloshe/vuurwerk-firmware
Copyright (c) 2026 James Honiball (KC3TFZ).
Complete base firmware and VUURWERK original radio functionality, including
TX compressor, adaptive squelch, scanning, Scan+Watch and UI features.
The original LICENSE, CREDITS.md and dedication are preserved. The upstream
LICENSE explicitly permits modifying and redistributing the complete firmware
under GPL v3, and states additional restrictions on extracting original modules.
