Armel (F4HWN), armel/uv-k5-firmware-custom
F4HWN single-VFO channel-name/frequency presentation and boxed S-meter style
adapted in the earlier display prototype; retained heritage and original
copyright notices in the custom ui/home.c implementation. Original Apache-2.0 notices and license preserved.

TA1JS / bcanata, bcanata/uv-k5-firmware-ta1js
Standalone BK4819 APRS receive setup, FIFO capture, NRZI/HDLC and FCS logic
adapted in app/aprs_rx.c and app/aprs_decode.c. Original source notice:
Copyright 2024 UV-K5 Firmware Custom. Apache License 2.0.
The TA1JS documentation credits F4JTV for its position decoders; this fork
excludes that parser source because a clear license was not found and uses
its own coordinate parsing implementation. No F4JTV APRS symbol graphics
or other resources are included.

